Package: libgweather-4-0
Version: @DEB_GWEATHER4_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libgweather
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libxml2, libgeocode-glib0, libsoup-3.0-0
Description: GNOME weather/location library (libgweather-4)
 libgweather-4 for rootless iOS. gnome-shell imports gi://GWeather (4.0) in
 dateMenu.js at boot, so this library and its on-device GWeather-4.0 typelib are
 required for the shell to start. Weather is inert without a geoclue location
 daemon, but the typelib must exist for the static import.
